flowchart TB
    User[Authenticated User]
    IdP[Identity Provider]
    GW[API Gateway]
    Service[Owning Service]
    Policy[Authorization Policy]
    Data[(Owned Data)]

    User --> IdP
    IdP --> User

    User -->|Token| GW
    GW -->|Validated Identity Context| Service

    Service --> Policy
    Policy --> Data

    Policy -->|Allow / Deny| Service
